[00:20.06]1. Signs of the times are pointing to the Kingdom.
[00:24.84]Good news we tell for all to hear.
[00:29.64]Lift up your heads, and look to your salvation;
[00:33.86]Time for deliverance is near!
[00:38.02](Chorus)
[00:38.80]The joy of Jehovah is our stronghold.
[00:42.82]Sing loud, and raise a joyful cry.
[00:48.42]Rejoice in the hope, and show a grateful heart,
[00:52.70]All give praise and laud our God on high.
[00:57.36]The joy of Jehovah is our stronghold.
[01:02.58]His greatness all must come to know.
[01:07.46]With constant devotion to our God and King,
[01:11.82]Godly joy in service we will show.
[01:27.22]2. Look to our God, you lovers of Jehovah.
[01:32.06]No need to fear, for he is strong.
[01:36.10]Stand up and shout with voices loud as thunder;
[01:41.14]Sing to our God a joyful song!
[01:45.92](Chorus)
[01:45.92]The joy of Jehovah is our stronghold.
[01:50.70]Sing loud, and raise a joyful cry.
[01:55.12]Rejoice in the hope, and show a grateful heart,
[02:00.08]All give praise and laud our God on high.
[02:04.44]The joy of Jehovah is our stronghold.
[02:09.32]His greatness all must come to know.
[02:14.78]With constant devotion to our God and King,
[02:19.36]Godly joy in service we will show.
